  "content": "\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/undertale-death-screen-continued\">\n        <img alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/undertale-death-screen-continued\">\n        <img alt=\"CurseForge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/Denmoth/undertale-death-screen-continued\">\n        <img alt=\"GitHub\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/BCXqNfPnSh\">\n        <img alt=\"Discord\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/denmoth\">\n        <img alt=\"Ko-fi\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n</div>\n\n# Undertale 死亡畫面：持續版\n\nUndertale Death Screen Continued 是 Raik176 原版模組的直接分支。由於原版已長時間未更新或移植，本專案透過持續維護、修復錯誤以及移植至新版 Minecraft，讓此模組得以延續。\n\n讓你在死亡時，最後一顆心會像《Undertale》一樣碎裂！\n\n![死亡範例](https://i.imgur.com/p5Ql0OT.gif)\n\n## 鳴謝與支援\n\n本模組為持續積極維護的分支版本。所有原始構想與基礎程式碼皆歸屬於原作者。 \n\n* **原始作者：** [Raik176](https://github.com/Raik176)\n  * [原始倉庫](https://github.com/Raik176/undertale-death-screen)\n  * ☕ [在 Ko-fi 上支持 Raik176](https://ko-fi.com/R6R3163YVT)\n\n* **目前維護者：** [Denmoth](https://github.com/Denmoth)\n  * ☕ [在 Ko-fi 上支持 Denmoth](https://ko-fi.com/denmoth)\n\n*依 MIT 授權條款分發。*",
